course: dictionary
lesson: 15088
title: Roi: a French king and a business word
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Roi is not an English word. It is French, and it means king: «le roi» is "the king". To an English ear it sounds like «rwah». You cannot guess it from English, so you have to learn it.
explain: In French lessons you meet it in «le roi et la reine» (the king and the queen). The plural is «les rois», which means "the kings".
explain: In English, ROI is written in capitals and means something different: return on investment. «Our ROI was good this year, so we earned back more than we spent.» Here the money and business words are the clues.
explain: Context tells you which meaning to use. If the sentence is French, or talks about a king, it is roi. If it talks about money, profit or business, it is ROI. Always check the clues around the word.
fact: Roi is a French noun meaning king.
fact: «Le roi» means "the king" and «les rois» means "the kings".
fact: «La galette des rois» is a French cake eaten at Epiphany.
fact: ROI in English stands for return on investment: the money you get back compared with what you spent.
fact: The French word roi is hidden inside the English names Detroit and Leroy.
exercise: In French, «le roi» means what? | the crown | the queen | *the king | the castle
exercise: «Our ROI on the new bike shop was high, so we earned back more than we spent.» What does ROI stand for? | record of income | *return on investment | river of ice | rest on island
exercise: Which word is the plural of «le roi»? | les roi | le château | la reine | *les rois
test: «Le roi et la reine dansent.» What does roi mean in this sentence? | dance | castle | *king | return on investment
test: The shop's ROI was fifty percent, so the owner got back more money than was spent. What does ROI mean here? | river of income | rest on impulse | *return on investment | a king of the market
exam: Which clue shows that ROI means return on investment in «Our ROI was good this year»? | The sentence is about the weather | The sentence is written in French | The sentence is about a king | *The sentence is about money and business
